============================================================
M. COMMON ERRORS AND SOLUTIONS
============================================================
1. "docker is not recognized"
   - Docker Desktop may not be installed or running.
   - Restart the terminal after installation.
   - Open Docker Desktop and wait until it is running.

2. Docker daemon / engine error
   - Open Docker Desktop.
   - Wait for Docker Engine to start.
   - Check WSL 2 setup if the error continues.

3. Port 5000 is already in use
   - Run the container with another host port:

     docker run -d --name ai-model-container -p 5001:5000 ai-model-app

   - Then open http://localhost:5001

4. Container exits immediately
   - Check logs:

     docker logs ai-model-container

   - Verify app.py and Dockerfile are saved correctly.

5. Cannot access the API
   - Confirm the container is running:

     docker ps

   - Confirm the browser uses http://localhost:5000
   - Confirm the Docker run command includes -p 5000:5000

6. Name already in use
   - Remove the old container:

     docker rm -f ai-model-container

   - Run the docker run command again.

